{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856748-rp-question-what-would-an-unchained-make-of-the-horror-recognition-guide","id":856748,"title":"RP Question: What Would An Unchained Make of the Horror Recognition Guide?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-31T15:41:19-07:00","id":856748,"title":"RP Question: What Would An Unchained Make of the Horror Recognition Guide?","content":"For those of you that don't know, the HRG is an anthology of various stories collected by a particular cell of hunters before their mysterious vanishing in an incident related to a supernatural serial killer farmer (in that the Sower is both a supernatural being and that he kills them as his primary prey). It's also presented as an in-universe document the Cheiron Group and Task Force Valkyrie found-and lost, when an unknown thief nicked it from Cheiron. <br /> <br /> I'm also planning on a Let's Read of it, wherein I take the persona of said thief-who is, as you may have surmised, an Unchained; the idea is that the good Sir Night (a reference to my username, and because I like the idea of a laid-back demonic knight whose cult is effectively his knightly order) happened to follow a trail that crossed paths with the Close Encounters story, and he learned about both the cell and their vast degree of experience. He also is fascinated with other types of supernatural being, hoping to study them in order to gain a better grasp of occult physics, so when he learned of a book collating all their information and intelligence, he just had to have it for himself. The idea is that the thread for the Let's Read is him posting his commentary on the stories to his Free Agency and connecting them to his personal findings, having spent several years chasing the leads the book gave him.<br /> <br /> Which leads me to the question here: How would you think an Unchained who believes occult physics are the foundation of all weird things in the CofD fit the stories into his own personal worldview (to the extent he can; his reaction to the whole Snake Vs Bird thing is going to be along the lines of &quot;man what?&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T18:38:11-07:00","id":856826,"title":"","content":"The nice thing about Occult Physics, as I understand it, is that it actually takes the powers at face value (maybe with some stripping away of mythological BS). Vampires power just work the way they do (and knowing how let's you exploit similar loop-holes and tricks), not because you explain &quot;it was done with Arcana X&quot; or &quot;Must be some Spirit Gift&quot;. As former Angels, Demons likely know there is all sorts of weird shit in the shadows, even if they don't know any details.<br /> <br /> I could seem them casting events in light of previous experiences, and maybe try to determine the specific parameters for how things work. Still might get the occasional &quot;wait, <i>what</i> exists?&quot; curveball.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T22:49:41-07:00","id":856962,"title":"","content":"Information like that is doubly useful because not only is is information about whatever wiped out the cell, it also gives insight into the methods and sources used by hunters.<br /> <br /> Looking forward to this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T07:12:08-07:00","id":857110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856748-rp-question-what-would-an-unchained-make-of-the-horror-recognition-guide#post856748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the idea of a laid-back demonic knight whose cult is effectively his knightly order</div> </div> </div> </div>As an aside, I love the idea of non-&quot;standard&quot; cults like this. Is the Unchained the Grandmaster, or some &quot;historical&quot; patron?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-01T10:00:38-07:00","id":857179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856748-rp-question-what-would-an-unchained-make-of-the-horror-recognition-guide?p=856826#post856826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The nice thing about Occult Physics, as I understand it, is that it actually takes the powers at face value (maybe with some stripping away of mythological BS). Vampires power just work the way they do (and knowing how let's you exploit similar loop-holes and tricks), not because you explain &amp;quot;it was done with Arcana X&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;Must be some Spirit Gift&amp;quot;. As former Angels, Demons likely know there is all sorts of weird shit in the shadows, even if they don't know any details.<br /> <br /> I could seem them casting events in light of previous experiences, and maybe try to determine the specific parameters for how things work. Still might get the occasional &amp;quot;wait, <i>what</i> exists?&amp;quot; curveball.</div> </div> </div> </div> I second this notion. Demons lean toward scientific explanations, even if Sufficiently Advanced and thus arcane-sounding.<br /> <br /> For example: the Space Arcanum is not about Sympathy, it's about brainwave imprinting upon quantum entanglement, or something along those lines. Be careful not to make the terms cheesy. They should still be surrounded by a sense of religious awe, in the Biblical sense. This might be conveyed by how Angel X can compress and twist radio waves in apparently physics-defying ways, just to send cryptic omens in a code reminiscent of ancient Hebrew. Such transmissions might only be received by the cultists who have been &quot;annointed&quot; (i.e. the top of their skulls were surgically removed so a viscous mesh of nanomachines could be poured evenly over their exposed brains). Keep the aesthetics of the Adeptus Mechanicus and the clinical tone of the SCP Foundation in mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T04:17:47-07:00","id":857615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856748-rp-question-what-would-an-unchained-make-of-the-horror-recognition-guide?p=857110#post857110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As an aside, I love the idea of non-&quot;standard&quot; cults like this. Is the Unchained the Grandmaster, or some &quot;historical&quot; patron?</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically the Grandmaster, though he calls himself the High Paladin to seem a little more mystical and less superior (since he calls the stigmatic cultists his paladins).<br /> <br /> I didn't think of that though. Does give me an idea for the origin story he lays out to them, and a reason for one of his main goals, making sure the cult remains a force even after he dies. Building a hunter Compact or perhaps a small Conspiracy, in other words.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-02T04:53:14-07:00","id":857624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/856748-rp-question-what-would-an-unchained-make-of-the-horror-recognition-guide?p=857615#post857615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Technically the Grandmaster, though he calls himself the High Paladin to seem a little more mystical and less superior (since he calls the stigmatic cultists his paladins).<br /> <br /> I didn't think of that though. Does give me an idea for the origin story he lays out to them, and a reason for one of his main goals, making sure the cult remains a force even after he dies. Building a hunter Compact or perhaps a small Conspiracy, in other words.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. Ready-made Endowment: Gadgets.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgflip.com/11u2y5.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}